            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[Углы треугольника KED K, E и D равны  соответственно 30°, 90° и 60° ]]></content>
        </node>
        <node type="node/const/perm/general" idtf="" shapeColor="0" id="101107385827296" parent="0" x="1070.26" y="379.289" haveBus="false" idtf_pos="0">
            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[If side AB is equal to side DE and side AC is equal to side DK, then side BC is equal to side EK.
]]></content>
        </node>
